---
// src/pages/privacy-policy.astro
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Cozivara Living"
  description="How the Cozivara Living website and browser-based room planner handle information."
>
  <section class="py-14 sm:py-20 bg-cozi-bg">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-cozi-border">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-cozi-charcoal/70 block mb-2">LEGAL DOCUMENTATION</span>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-cozi-charcoal/60 mt-2">Last updated: October 25, 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose-cozi max-w-none text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed space-y-6">
        <p>
          This policy describes the behavior implemented in the current Cozivara Living website source. Hosting and third-party providers may process information under their own policies.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal mt-8 mb-4">1. Contact and newsletter</h2>
        <p>
          When this site is hosted on Netlify, the contact form submits the name, email address, subject, and message to Netlify Forms for delivery to the site's submissions inbox. The site owner can configure email notifications in Netlify. Netlify processes and stores those submissions under its own service terms and retention controls. The local development preview opens an email draft instead. Newsletter signup is not currently available. If you use the direct email link, your email provider and the recipient process its contents.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal mt-8 mb-4">2. Room planner</h2>
        <p>
          When you save a room design, the planner stores it in your browser's local storage on that device. The saved design remains in that browser until you clear it or remove it using the planner. The current planner does not send the saved design to Cozivara Living.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal mt-8 mb-4">3. External services and links</h2>
        <p>
          Pages load images from Unsplash and fonts from Google Fonts, and include links to external retailers and sharing services. When your browser requests an external resource or you follow an external link, that provider may receive connection data and handle it under its own privacy policy. AdSense is disabled unless the site owner supplies a valid publisher ID and enables Auto ads. If advertising is activated, Google may use cookies or similar technologies to deliver and measure ads; the site owner must publish accurate disclosures and configure an appropriate consent message before serving ads where required.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal mt-8 mb-4">4. Privacy requests</h2>
        <p>
          If you have a privacy question or request, contact us using the address below. Rights and response periods depend on applicable law and the circumstances. For example, California's current privacy rules generally require covered businesses to respond to requests to know, delete, or correct within 45 calendar days, with a possible additional 45 days after notice. See the <a href="https://cppa.ca.gov/faq/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cozi-olive underline">California Privacy Protection Agency FAQ</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal mt-8 mb-4">5. Data protection rights</h2>
        <p>
          Where data protection laws apply, they may provide rights regarding personal information. Contact us with a request and we will review it under the applicable requirements.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal mt-8 mb-4">6. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          If you have additional questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy or data protection practices, do not hesitate to contact us at <a href="mailto:cozivaraliving2495@gmail.com" class="text-cozi-olive underline font-medium">cozivaraliving2495@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
